        <h4 class="cag-h4">Can a Congo and a Timneh Live as a Pair?</h4>
        <p>As companions, yes — the photograph above is our own birds. As a breeding pair, no, and we would not set one up. Different subspecies, and it is not what either bird is for.</p>

